   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Cloudflare Workflows provides durable multi-step execution, retries, persisted state, scheduling/sleep, and observability."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T08:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T08:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "fb70108f-8699-4672-9208-71d9498c66b7",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Cloudflare Workflows Free is bounded: 100,000 requests/day, 10ms CPU per invocation, 1 GB-month storage, and 3,000 steps/day; workflow state is retained 3 days on Free by default. Workflows step/storage billing began August 10, 2026."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-27T08:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-27T08:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "696169fa-c1a8-40f8-a84f-48e7f281886f",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
